		*m: didsoitem_usestock
		*m: editcontactscreen
		*m: editpo		&& Read SQL and places as field value
		*m: edit_po		&& Usually ignored as ThisFormSet.EditPO() is the usual.
		*m: fillvendoraddr
		*m: fix_acct_stnd
		*m: getvendorcontacts
		*m: importsoitem
		*m: makenewpoitem
		*m: movepoi_lst		&& move a POitem from a Lst to be entered in anther Lst
		*m: notify_wo		&& Notify need WO  on Conversion Service PO
		*m: poaddress_screen
		*m: poi_total		&& calculate POi_Total
		*m: popounds		&& Use GetWeight for PO item
		*m: poscreen		&& ENABLE, DISABLE, CLEAR
		*m: posetvendor
		*m: poshipto
		*m: potestingscreen
		*m: po_cancel		&& Cancel or Uncancel POitem
		*m: po_new		&& PO_New
		*m: po_saveadd
		*m: po_valid
		*m: printpo		&& PrintPO(nHPApo)
		*m: refreshpoforms
		*m: refresh_ac_pu		&& Accounting Unit Price Unit
		*m: refresh_pu
		*m: removepo_stocklst
		*m: returnquotedtable		&& Returns a Table tmpQuoted
		*m: savecontactid
		*m: savesalesship
		*m: savestocklst
		*m: save_podist
		*m: setpoitems
		*m: setstocklst_qty
		*m: shiptoclear
		*m: shipwherechange
		*m: showpoitem		&& Reads SQL and places as Value
		*m: showposhipaddr
		*m: showposhipto
		*m: showpotesting
		*m: showvendcode
		*m: showvendorcontact
		*m: show_frmpo
		*m: show_so_dist
		*m: show_vendcode
		*m: sodistclear
		*m: stocklst_process_custom_save
		*m: stocklst_process_remove_custom
		*m: stocklst_process_save
		*m: stock_select_process
		*m: sumstocklstcost
		*m: testingclear
		*m: testshipwhere		&& Test ShipWhere
		*m: unify_terms
		*m: vendcodeclear
		*m: vendorclear
		*p: cc
		*p: cl
		*p: comments		&& Caries SO Comments to PO Misc_Purchase
		*p: cpoitem
		*p: csoitem
		*p: descript		&& Carries SO Descript to PO Cond_Spec
		*p: editsalesorder		&& True if class called from EditSalesOrder
		*p: itemnumber
		*p: nconnhandle
		*p: ncontactid
		*p: nvendcode
		*p: poediting
